> Frances Carolyn Sedberry[,] 66[ of] Middleburg, FL passed away Thursday, May 17, 2018.[ Mrs]. Sed[berry was] born in Baton Rouge[,] LA[ to the late] Cleavern[ and] Betty Grimball B[rouss]ard[,] Jr.[ She loved] her family[ with a] fiery passion.
[Mrs]. Sed[berry] was preceded in death[ by her] parents[ and] brother[,] Cleavern B[rouss]ard[,] III[. She] is survived by her loving[ husband,] Charles Sed[berry,] daughter[,] Betty Irene Sed[berry,] two grandsons[,] Charles and Aaron Sedberry[,] sister[,] Doris B[rouss]ard Michelli, brother[,] Donald Brou[ss]ard,[ many] cousins[,] nieces, nephews. She is also survived by several whom she saw as and claimed as daughters, sons[, and] grandchildren. She[ will] be dearly[ missed].
